# Testing

## Required

- New metric calculation functions must have unit tests.
- Bug fixes must include a test that reproduces the bug.
- Tests must be reproducible and must not use production secrets.
- Do not disable tests just to make CI green.

## Backend (Go)

Cover:

- Throughput, Lead Time, Cycle Time;
- start/done detection and bug reopen;
- multiple execution cycles;
- period filtering/aggregation;
- incomplete history and exclusion of unreliable events;
- sync idempotency and import resume (integration).

## Frontend

Cover metric rendering, filters, empty/error states, data-quality warnings, Trello links, and role-based UI.

## Spike / research

For a research change (e.g. `spike-trello-history`), verifiable artifacts and documented experiment results are enough; do not implement a full analytics engine "while you're at it".
